<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan auctions 500 mln tenge bills April 15.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan auctions 500 mln tenge bills April 15.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 500 million tenge of three-month GKO discount Treasury bills on April 15, the National Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ43K1707977</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   500 million tenge</p>
<p>    Issue date		     April 15</p>
<p>    Tenor			    91 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  July 17</p>
<p>Three-month paper yielded 23.19 percent at the last auction on April 8.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
